,"height":33}]},{"text":"조에서 찾으면 inode 번호 대신 UNIX는 〈major, minor〉 장치 번호를 얻게 된다.","words":[{"text":"조에서","x":285,"y":2194,"width":83,"height":35},{"text":"찾으면","x":386,"y":2195,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"inode","x":487,"y":2200,"width":83,"height":28},{"text":"번호","x":587,"y":2197,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"대신","x":658,"y":2197,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"UNIX는","x":729,"y":2198,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"〈major,","x":867,"y":2199,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"minor〉","x":1016,"y":2200,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"장치","x":1151,"y":2199,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"번호를","x":1237,"y":2199,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"얻게","x":1359,"y":2200,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"된다.","x":1441,"y":2201,"width":68,"height":36}]},{"text":"주(major) 장지 번호는 이 장치에 대한 입출력을 처리하기 위해 호출할 장치 드라이버","words":[{"text":"주(major)","x":284,"y":2256,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"장지","x":434,"y":2254,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"번호는","x":507,"y":2255,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":606,"y":2256,"width":24,"height":35},{"text":"장치에","x":647,"y":2255,"width":84,"height":36},{"text":"대한","x":747,"y":2255,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"입출력을","x":821,"y":2256,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"처리하기","x":955,"y":2258,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"위해","x":1098,"y":2259,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"호출할","x":1177,"y":2259,"width":105,"height":35},{"text":"장치","x":1296,"y":2260,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"드라이버","x":1380,"y":2261,"width":127,"height":36}]}]}